# JavaScript Arrays and Functions Assignment

I created this project for my JS task to perform operations on array elements using functions.

## What I Did
- Created `index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js` files in my project folder.
- Defined a test array `[4, 8, 2, 11, 6, 7, 10]`.
- Used an arrow function `findMax` to loop through array and find maximum value.
- Used an anonymous function `calculateSum` to calculate total sum of array elements.
- Used a standard function `countOdd` to count odd numbers using modulus `%` operator.
- Printed all outputs to console using `console.log()` and displayed them on the webpage screen.